eneral handshape categories and Java maps them to illustrative phrases. Android SpeechRecognizer displays live text where a compatible service is available. SQLite stores communication and practice data locally. Firebase Authentication, Realtime Database and Cloud Firestore support account profiles, live rooms and optional progress sync." android:layout_marginTop="9dp"/></LinearLayout><LinearLayout android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:layout_marginTop="12dp" android:padding="20dp" android:orientation="vertical" android:background="@drawable/bg_card_v3"><TextView android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:textSize="12sp" android:textColor="@color/primary" android:text="PRIVACY AND LIMITATIONS" android:textStyle="bold"/><TextView android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:textSize="15sp" android:textColor="@color/ink" android:text="Camera frames and landmarks remain on-device. Speech recognition may rely on the phone’s speech service and may process audio online. Long lectures require active supervision and may miss words. Selected Photo Picker images are previewed locally and are not uploaded. Firebase room messages are not end-to-end encrypted. The seven gestures are not official Bangla Sign Language signs." android:layout_marginTop="9dp"/></LinearLayout><LinearLayout android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:layout_marginTop="12dp" android:padding="20dp" android:orientation="vertical" android:background="@drawable/bg_card_v3"><TextView android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:textSize="12sp" android:textColor="@color/primary" android:text="DEVELOPER" android:textStyle="bold"/><TextView android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content" android:textSize="15sp" android:textColor="@color/ink" android:text="Md. Atif Absar" android:layout_marginTop="9dp